"""
SprintOS MVP
============
A local, dependency-free idea execution engine.

Run:
    python sprintos.py

Then open:
    http://127.0.0.1:8844

Optional AI mode:
    export SPRINTOS_AI_PROVIDER="openai"  # or "deepseek"
    export SPRINTOS_AI_ENABLED="true"
    export SPRINTOS_MODEL="gpt-4.1-mini"
    export OPENAI_API_KEY="your_key_here"
    python sprintos.py

No API key? The app still works in offline template mode.
"""

